---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/project/ProjectNav.astro';
import NextProject from '../components/project/NextProject.astro';
import '../styles/projects/pharmatrack.css';
---

<ProjectLayout title="PharmaTrack · Sasha">
<div class="page" style="font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2E2326; background: #F6F1EA; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 110px">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #CFE6DC 0%, #E4EEE6 55%, #F6F1EA 100%); padding-bottom: 48px">
<ProjectNav />
<header class="wrap" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 88px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; color: #2F5A47">Healthcare system</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 128px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.92">PharmaTrack.</h1>
<p style="margin: 28px auto 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436; text-wrap: balance">Pharmacists kept struggling to see which medicines were about to expire. So we built them a system to track it, and while we were at it, a shop where customers can order the medicine too.</p>
</header>
<div class="col" style="margin-top: 48px">
<div class="meta" style="text-align: left">
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4D6B5D">Year</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">2026</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4D6B5D">Team</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">SE Group 5</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4D6B5D">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">System analysis, UI/UX, testing</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4D6B5D">Live</p><a href="https://se-group5.vercel.app" style="font-weight: 600; display: block">Store ↗</a><a href="https://se-group5.vercel.app/admin" style="font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-top: 4px">Admin panel ↗</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #B9DCCB 0%, #CFE6DC 55%, #E4EEE6 100%)">
<div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">se-group5.vercel.app</span></div>
<img src="assets/pharmatrack-hero.webp" alt="PharmaTrack landing page: order medicine online, pick up at the pharmacy" style="width: 100%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 80px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">It started with expiry dates</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px">The pharmacists' real headache was simple: it was hard to see which medicines were close to expiring. Stock that expires on the shelf is money thrown away.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">So the admin side came first: stock, expiry alerts and stock opname in one place. Once all the stock data lived in one system, adding a shop on top made sense. Customers search, order online, then pick up and pay at the pharmacy.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<div class="duo">
<figure style="margin: 0"><div class="panel" style="background: #E4EEE6"><div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/produk</span></div><img src="assets/pharmatrack-catalog.webp" alt="PharmaTrack product catalog with stock badges and prices" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">Catalog with live stock status: available or sold out.</figcaption></figure>
<figure style="margin: 0"><div class="panel" style="background: #CFE6DC"><div class="browser round tilt2" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/checkout</span></div><img src="assets/pharmatrack-checkout.webp" alt="PharmaTrack checkout with buyer details, payment method and order summary" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">Checkout: pay by transfer/QRIS or at the pharmacy on pickup.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">System features</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Online medicine catalog</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Stock management</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Expiration monitoring</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">User authentication</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Order management</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Responsive web interface</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">AI pharmacist assistant</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">QRIS &amp; pay-at-pickup</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Stock opname</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Alerts &amp; expiry tracking</span>
<span style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DCE8E0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px">Sales reports &amp; KPI dashboard</span>
</div>

<figure style="margin: 40px 0 0"><div class="stage sm" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #E4EEE6 0%, #CFE6DC 100%)"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">se-group5.vercel.app/#cara-pesan</span></div><img src="assets/pharmatrack-howto.webp" alt="Popular categories and the four-step ordering flow: search, order online, pick up, pay at the cashier" style="width: 100%; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">Ordering in four steps: search, order online, pick up, pay at the cashier.</figcaption></figure>

<div style="margin-top: 40px; background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 28px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px; align-items: center">
<img src="assets/pharmatrack-ai.webp" alt="Apoteker AI chat assistant with a medical disclaimer" style="width: min(260px, 100%); flex: none; display: block; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -24px rgba(47,90,71,0.6); transform: rotate(-3deg)">
<div style="flex: 1 1 260px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #2F5A47">Apoteker AI</p>
<p style="margin: 0">A built-in assistant answers general questions about over-the-counter medicines sold in the store. It clearly states it is not a doctor and points users to a licensed pharmacist for serious symptoms or prescription drugs.</p>
</div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Technologies used</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">Next.js</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">JavaScript</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">PostgreSQL</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">Prisma ORM</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">HTML &amp; CSS</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">Figma</span>
<span style="background: #CFE6DC; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5A47">Git &amp; GitHub</span>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: 64px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3EDE6; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #2F5A47">My part</p>
<p style="margin: 0">I started by studying how a pharmacy actually runs day to day, then turned that into the feature list. From there I drew the wireframes and prototypes in Figma, and later helped test the app and write the documentation.</p>
</div>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<figure style="margin: 0"><div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #CFE6DC 0%, #B9DCCB 100%)"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">se-group5.vercel.app/admin</span></div><img src="assets/pharmatrack-admin.webp" alt="PharmaTrack admin KPI dashboard with revenue, completion rate, inventory risk and order status charts" style="width: 100%; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="max-width: 760px; margin: 14px auto 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60; text-align: center">Admin KPI dashboard: revenue, completion rate, inventory risk (critical stock and near-expiry), order status and top products, with an AI summary shortcut.</figcaption></figure>
</div>

<div class="col" style="padding-top: 96px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B5F60; font-weight: 600">Next project</p>
<NextProject href="forecasting.html" name="Demand Forecasting" bg="#F3D9C8" />
</div>
</div>
</ProjectLayout>
